  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMaximumTermOfOptionsGrantedForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity01205851_StockoptionsmemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2026-09-19</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMaximumTermOfOptionsGrantedForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity01205851_StockoptionsmemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">주식결제형</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity01205851_EventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 2026년 7월 28일자 이사회에서 반기배당(주당 1,300원, 총액 468억원)을 결의하였으며, 2026년 8월 27일에 배당금 지급 예정입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity01205851_EventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 2026년 7월 28일자 이사회에서 반기배당(주당 1,300원, 총액 468억원)을 결의하였으며, 2026년 8월 27일에 배당금 지급 예정입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_AdministrativeAppealForRevocationOfTheFairTradeCommissionsSanctionAndSurchargeDispositionRelatedToTheCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulHighCourtCaseNo2025Nu6106OfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">한전에 공급되는 170kV GIS 부당공동행위와 관련한 공정위의 시정명령 및 과징금(66.99억원) 부과 처분에 대한 취소를 구하는 소송을 제기함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_AdministrativeLitigationForRevocationOfTheDispositionOnBidParticipationRestrictionEtcRelatedToTheCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulAdministrativeCourtCaseNo2025Guhap54809OfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">한전은 2025. 7. 17. 공공기관운영법 등에 근거하여 2025. 7. 25.부터 2026. 1. 24까지 6개월 동안 연결실체의 입찰참가자격을 제한하고, 170kV GIS 유자격자등록을 취소하는 처분을 함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_CanadianLargeTransformerAntiDumpingNvr101102104120AppealCanadianInternationalTradeTribunalMemberOfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2020년 ~ 2021년 연결실체가 캐나다로 수출한 변압기 반덤핑 관세 일부에 대해 국제무역재판소(CITT)에 항소를 제기</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_KoreaHydroNuclearPowerKhnpCompensationClaimLawsuitSeoulHighCourt2024Na2052411MemberOfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">원고에 공급되는 170kV GIS 부당공동행위와 관련하여 공정위가 10개사의 담합 사실이 있었다고 판단함에 따라, 원고는 연결실체를 포함한 10개사를 공동피고로 하여 손해배상을 청구함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_ifrs-full_OtherContingentLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 2017년 4월 1일을 분할기일로 HD한국조선해양㈜에서 인적분할되어 설립되었으며, 상법 제530조의 9 제1항의 규정에 의거 분할전 회사의 채무에 대하여연대하여 변제할 책임이 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_AdministrativeAppealForRevocationOfTheFairTradeCommissionsSanctionAndSurchargeDispositionRelatedToTheCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulHighCourtCaseNo2025Nu6106OfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">한전에 공급되는 170kV GIS 부당공동행위와 관련한 공정위의 시정명령 및 과징금(66.99억원) 부과 처분에 대한 취소를 구하는 소송을 제기함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_AdministrativeLitigationForRevocationOfTheDispositionOnBidParticipationRestrictionEtcRelatedToTheCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulAdministrativeCourtCaseNo2025Guhap54809OfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">한전은 2025. 7. 17. 공공기관운영법 등에 근거하여 2025. 7. 25.부터 2026. 1. 24까지 6개월 동안 당사의 입찰참가자격을 제한하고, 170kV GIS 유자격자등록을 취소하는 처분을 함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_CanadianLargeTransformerAntiDumpingNvr101102104120AppealCanadianInternationalTradeTribunalMemberOfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2020년 ~ 2021년 당사가 캐나다로 수출한 변압기 반덤핑 관세 일부에 대해 국제무역재판소(CITT)에 항소를 제기</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_CivilActionForDamagesRelatingToCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulEasternDistrictCourtCaseNo2025Gahap101418OfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">원고에 공급되는 170kV GIS 부당공동행위와 관련하여 공정위가 10개사의 담합 사실이 있었다고 판단함에 따라, 원고는 당사를 포함한 10개사를 공동피고로 하여 손해배상을 청구함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_ifrs-full_OtherContingentLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 2017년 4월 1일을 분할기일로 HD한국조선해양㈜에서 인적분할되어 설립되었으며, 상법 제530조의 9 제1항의 규정에 의거 분할전 회사의 채무에 대하여 연대하여 변제할 책임이 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
